<hgroup><h1>Effectiveness of Intermittent Fasting and Time-Restricted Feeding Compared to Continuous Energy Restriction for Weight Loss</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Rynders%20CA"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Corey A Rynders</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
